[2026-11-02T01:52:17.532Z] [iframe] subkind=send-capture {"at":"2026-11-02T01:52:17.523Z","blockTop":-1,"escId":"send-1793584337523-2","firstOutputSeen":true,"menuPresent":false,"meta":{"baseY":102,"bufLen":151,"header":"","liveRows":151,"optionCount":0,"termRows":49},"rows":["  12. Mass Spectra — Gaussian noise, σ/√w, thresholding","  13. Cell Segmentation — 2D Gaussian, convolution","  14. Wealth Inequality — Gini coefficient, Lorenz curve","  15. Topic Modeling — TF vectors, L2 norm, k-means","  16. Signal Detection Theory — HR/FAR, ROC, AUC","  17. Spatial Interpolation — IDW, cross-validation","  18. Inter-Rater Agreement — Cohen's kappa, standard error","  19. Word Frequency Change — OLS slope","","  Calculus (PDE/ODE) and numerical methods","  20. 1D Diffusion — finite differences, Taylor series, truncation error","  21. Heat Conduction — steady-state PDE, Jacobi iteration","  22. Predator-Prey — ODE, equilibrium, linearization","  23. SIR Epidemic — ODE + least-squares fitting","","  Machine learning / inferential statistics","  24. Mineral Classification — logistic regression, gradient descent","  25. Tumor Classification — logistic regression","  26. Learning Curve — nonlinear least squares, covariance, CI","  27. Exoplanet Detection — sinusoid fit, Cramér-Rao, significance","  28. Price Elasticity — log-log OLS, standard error, t CI","  29. Flood Frequency — log-normal, method of moments, return periods","  30. Survival Analysis — maximum-likelihood, censoring","  31. Structural Break Detection — CUSUM, detrending, critical values","","  I've proposed the reorder as a worklist item (reorder-lessons-by-difficulty,","  touching README.md only) rather than editing the file directly, since Bram is","  running and the conventions route repo changes through the worklist. The full","  before/after is in the item draft.","","  Click Start on the item to approve the edit, and I'll apply the reorder.","  Introduction stays first, Conclusion last, appendices untouched.","","✻ Churned for 5m 20s","","────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────","❯","────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────","  ⏵⏵ accept edits on (shift+tab to cycle)                     86% context used",""],"source":"pty-intent-toTurn-submit","stage":"at-send"}
